{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Enfin, content de te voir, va.{{TAG:000A:000B:100A001200CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey, du bist's! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Was machst du denn
