{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Schön, dich zu sehen!{{TAG:000A:000B:100A001200CD}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Esta lluvia me recuerda...{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
