EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Not a big fan of the rain myself.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
My style gets soaked to the core.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ruins my day, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Justo hoy que me visto a la última,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
